<title>SWITZERLAND: SNB skips regular Thursday meeting before holiday.</title>
<headline>SNB skips regular Thursday meeting before holiday.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss National Bank will not hold its regular weekly meeting on Thursday, a spokesman for the Swiss National Bank (SNB) said in response to an enquiry.</p>
<p>Friday's upcoming Swiss national holiday has augmented the quiet summer tone in domestic markets.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
